: whether final split construction is scientifically feasible, under which leakage definition(s), and what claim boundaries must apply. Independently validate all consequential counts, update the report/decision/gate/status artifacts, run targeted tests, then commit and push.", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "graphify-out/memory/query_20260808_162858_below_is_the_group_comment__deeply_review_and_act.md", "source_location": "L10"}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_graphify_out_memory_query_20260808_162858_below_is_the_group_comment_deeply_review_and_act_answer", "label": "Answer", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "graphify-out/memory/query_20260808_162858_below_is_the_group_comment__deeply_review_and_act.md", "source_location": "L12"}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_graphify_out_memory_query_20260808_162858_below_is_the_group_comment_deeply_review_and_act_outcome", "label": "Outcome", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "graphify-out/memory/query_20260808_162858_below_is_the_group_comment__deeply_review_and_act.md", "source_location": "L16"}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_graphify_out_memory_query_20260808_162858_below_is_the_group_comment_deeply_review_and_act_source_nodes", "label": "Source Nodes", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "graphify-out/memory/query_20260808_162858_below_is_the_group_comment__deeply_review_and_act.md", "source_location": "L20"}], "edges": [{"source": "$graphify-root$_graphify_out_memory_query_20260808_162858_below_is_the_group_comment_deeply_review_and_act_md", "target": "$graphify-root$_graphify_out_memory_query_20260808_162858_below_is_the_group_comment_deeply_review_and_act_q_below_is_the_group_comment_deeply_review_and_act_accordingly_only_if_the_comments_are_valid_starting_from_the_current_main_state_and_accepted_dec_0018_conduct_a_bounded_pre_split_feasibility_and_leakage_stress_test_for_the_future_c1_c2_c3_benchmark_design_required_work_preserve_the_frozen_17_000_sequence_endpoint_universe_and_existing_40_30_20_mmseqs2_component